    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess variant as a civilization simulator. Based heavily on global conquest and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggle with resource management as you have to mine steel from nodes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between building options when you have to construct various structures to further your teams goals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize in different ways as the game allows for several different play styles and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused on your pieces positions and placement as they could be put into danger at any moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with your friends.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess variant as a civilization simulator. Based heavily on global conquest and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggle with resource management as you have to mine steel from nodes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between building options when you have to construct various structures to further your teams goals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize in different ways as the game allows for several different play styles and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused on your pieces positions and placement as they could be put into danger at any moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with your friends.</p></li></ul>",
